1" value="Don vi cong viec = MOT TRANG, khong phai mot file.
ocr-checkpoint khoa pdf_sha256#page_index#pipeline_version
lam at-least-once cua SQS tro nen vo hai; ocr-pagehash khoa
page_sha256 cho trang trung noi dung bo qua GPU hoan toan." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#ffffff,#0f1620);strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="band_note"><mxGeometry x="252" y="60" width="320" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n2" value="S3 ocr-artifacts giu .md - .html - COCO - parquet log-prob
- figures - searchable .pdf. KHONG luu anh render 300 DPI
(2M trang ~ 1,2 TB): preprocess va OCR nam cung mot process,
anh khong roi RAM." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#ffffff,#0f1620);strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="band_note"><mxGeometry x="624" y="60" width="320" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n3" value="Vong phan hoi fine-tune (net do dut do): trang duoi nguong
